@template warm
// One of the ten voice templates (the head writer, with social B). Its words match section 20c's VOICE_FALLBACK, so
// baking it changes nothing; the template's own lines (content/templates/warm.lines) come in wave 2.
talk: Kind, motherly or fatherly, generous with praise; asks after you.
hi: Hello, love | Hiya
bye: Take care | Look after yourself
yes: Of course | Happily
thanks: Thank you, really | Bless you
wow: Oh, lovely
sigh: Oh dear
nick: - | - | - | love | love
needs: share
